  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a blender or food processor, combine smoky sauce, Greek yogurt, monsoon chilies, fish sauce, and brown sugar. Blend until smooth.",
    "3. Season chicken breasts with salt and pepper.",
    "4. Grill chicken for 6-8 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "5. Brush chicken with the yogurt sauce during the last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "6. Serve chicken with a side of cooked bryani rice and additional yogurt sauce for dipping.",
    "7. Garnish with sliced monsoon chilies and a sprinkle of salt and pepper.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
